0) Store the notebook RISCChallenge.nb in your favorite directory.

1) Download Sigma.m available at
https://www3.risc.jku.at/research/combinat/software/Sigma/index.php

2) Dowload HarmonicSums.m available at
https://risc.jku.at/sw/harmonicsums/
In addition download all the supplemented .m files given at the webpage

3) EvaluateMultiSums.m available at
https://www3.risc.jku.at/research/combinat/software/EvaluateMultiSums/index.php

Note 1: To download the packages, you need a password. Just write a download request 
to Carsten.Schneider@risc.jku.at

Note 2: All files should be stored in a directory that the Mathematical kernel finds
automatically; a simple solution is to store all the files in the same directory
as the main notebook file 

Note 3: The packages can be freely used as stated in the Legal Notices and the
assumption that the mentioned literature is cited properly.


If everying is installed properly, you can carry out the calculations within
RISCChallenge.nb to derive (with a proof) the posed RISC challenge.
